{
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## NiteOut load test — live view\n\n**While a test runs**, watch these signals:\n\n| Signal | Good | Investigate |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Error rate** | stays **below 1%** | climbing or spiking |\n| **Latency p95** | mostly **under 1.5s** (reads) | sustained above 2–3s |\n| **Journey / Heartbeat** | near **100%** | dropping during steady load |\n| **VUs** | ramps to target (50 / 600…) | flat at 0 = test not running |\n\n**Client sign-off** uses the HTML report (`*-client-report.html`), not this dashboard. This is for engineers watching the run in real time."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Active users (VUs)",
      "description": "Concurrent virtual sessions. Should ramp up to your target (e.g. 50 or 600).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "id": 2,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "k6_vus", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "VUs" }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "blue", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Requests / second",
      "description": "Total API throughput from all virtual users.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 4 },
      "id": 3,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total[1m]))", "refId": "A" }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "HTTP error rate",
      "description": "Share of requests that failed. Target: below 1%.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "id": 4,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "k6_http_req_failed_rate", "refId": "A" }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.005 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.01 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Overall latency (p95)",
      "description": "95th percentile response time across all API calls.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 4 },
      "id": 5,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "k6_http_req_duration_p95", "refId": "A" }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1500 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 3000 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Users ramping up",
      "description": "Virtual users over time. You should see a step-up to your target, then a plateau.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 9 },
      "id": 6,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "k6_vus", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "Active VUs" }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 20, "spanNulls": false }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "API traffic (requests / sec)",
      "description": "How hard the backend is being hit.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 9 },
      "id": 7,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total[1m]))", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "Total RPS" }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 15 }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errors — HTTP vs app vs network",
      "description": "HTTP failed = any bad response. Application = API returned error. Transport = timeout / network.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 17 },
      "id": 8,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "k6_http_req_failed_rate", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "HTTP failed" },
        { "expr": "k6_application_error_rate", "refId": "B", "legendFormat": "Application errors" },
        { "expr": "k6_transport_error_rate", "refId": "C", "legendFormat": "Transport / timeout" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0.05,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2 },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.01 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Session health — journey & heartbeat",
      "description": "End-to-end user session success vs in-venue polling success. Both should stay near 100%.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 17 },
      "id": 9,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "k6_journey_success_rate", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "Full journey OK" },
        { "expr": "k6_heartbeat_success_rate", "refId": "B", "legendFormat": "Heartbeat polls OK" },
        { "expr": "k6_checks_rate", "refId": "C", "legendFormat": "Assertions OK" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0.9,
          "max": 1,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2 },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.98 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0.99 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "min"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latency by area — p95 (ms)",
      "description": "Venue / music / events = hot path (target p95 under 1.5s). Social = browse (under 2s). Chat = writes (under 3.5s).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 25 },
      "id": 10,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "k6_http_req_duration_p95{api_group=\"venue\"}", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "Venue" },
        { "expr": "k6_http_req_duration_p95{api_group=\"music\"}", "refId": "B", "legendFormat": "Music / heartbeat" },
        { "expr": "k6_http_req_duration_p95{api_group=\"events\"}", "refId": "C", "legendFormat": "Events" },
        { "expr": "k6_http_req_duration_p95{api_group=\"social\"}", "refId": "D", "legendFormat": "Social" },
        { "expr": "k6_http_req_duration_p95{api_group=\"chat\"}", "refId": "E", "legendFormat": "Chat writes" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 5 },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1500 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 3000 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Chat writes" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "thresholds", "value": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 3500 }, { "color": "red", "value": 5000 }] } }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max", "mean"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Overall latency — p95 & p99 (ms)",
      "description": "Tail latency across all calls. Spikes here mean something got slow even if averages look fine.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 34 },
      "id": 11,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "k6_http_req_duration_p95", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "p95" },
        { "expr": "k6_http_req_duration_p99", "refId": "B", "legendFormat": "p99" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2 },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1500 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 3000 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }
      }
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "10s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "style": "dark",
  "tags": ["niteout", "k6", "performance"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": { "from": "now-30m", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "NiteOut k6 — Live Load Test",
  "uid": "niteout-k6-overview",
  "version": 2,
  "description": "Live engineering view while a NiteOut k6 run is in progress. Use the HTML client report for formal pass/fail."
}
